[01:28.33]as you quietly descended six feet deep  我们静止着哭泣如同一幅画
[01:31.30]but the spirit ascended before our wet eyes  你的灵魂却在我们的眼泪中升华
[01:33.44]a gift from god, returned to sender  耶和华收回了这牺牲
[01:36.70]though I like to pretend that this never happened  可我还不愿承认，这一切的发生
[01:38.97]I can turn around and see you laughing  幻想当我一转身会有你朝我大笑
[01:41.20]but the fact is you could never practice  但事实上你却永远不可能
